    {
      "source": "Maps a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/ResultSet.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>ResultSet</code></a> to an entity of type <code>T</code>, including entities referenced. This <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jdbc/core/RowMapper.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core\"><code>RowMapper</code></a> might\ntrigger additional SQL statements in order to load other members of the same aggregate.",
      "translation": "将 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/ResultSet.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>ResultSet</code></a> 映射为类型 <code>T</code> 的实体（包括引用的实体）。此 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jdbc/core/RowMapper.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core\"><code>RowMapper</code></a> 可能会触发额外的 SQL 语句，以加载同一聚合中的其他成员。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
